35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, my findings confirm the risk. Hardware requires outside appraisals, adding six weeks and fees. Software reports only its own dashboard figures. We cannot verify the latter independently.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
